  "question": {
    "text": "Group-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>13</mn></math> elements react with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> in amorphous form to form oxides of type <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>=</mo></math>&nbsp;element). Which among the following is the most basic oxide?",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "2K16J",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Al</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "FHW6S",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "mEQIU",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Tl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gDcE8",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Ga</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
